# wlroots 0.20 and the libraries newer than the distribution's come in
# the source tarball (tools/dist.sh) and are linked in statically; these
# are what they and fluxland build against. (libxcb-errors-dev, for
# wlroots' X11 error messages, isn't in Ubuntu 24.04; Debian can add it.)
