Package: fluxland
Architecture: any
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Recommends: xwayland, foot, xdg-desktop-portal-wlr, xdg-desktop-portal-gtk
Suggests: grim, slurp, wl-clipboard, swaylock
Description: Fluxbox-inspired Wayland compositor
 Fluxland is a Wayland compositor that works the way Fluxbox does: an
 existing ~/.fluxbox (init, keys, apps, menu, styles) works unchanged,
 or is imported with fluxland --import-fluxbox. It has Fluxbox's
 toolbar, slit, tabs, menus, key chains and modes, window rules and
 styles, and runs X11 programs through Xwayland.
 .
 It is built on wlroots 0.20, which is linked in statically.
